# Copy to .env (gitignored) to try GitHub sign-in with `pnpm dev`. Use a GitHub OAuth
# App made for local development: its callback URL must be
# http://localhost:4321/auth/github/callback (see deploy/README.md §7).
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Your numeric GitHub user ID (the "id" at https://api.github.com/users/<your-login>).
ADMIN_GITHUB_IDS=
